# Directives for ks_vm_test (appended to the imported script). Without a self player the
# admin check of "o" reads null.username: a contained runtime error, the menu stays closed.
#! call onKeyPress "o" 79
#! call render 16
#! call onKeyPress "p" 80
# Player 0 is the admin "Iniquity_Games": "o" opens the admin menu
#! self 0 Iniquity_Games
#! call onKeyPress "o" 79
#! call render 16
#! call onMouseScroll -1
#! call onMouseScroll -1
#! call onKeyPress "=" 187
#! call onKeyPress "=" 187
#! call onKeyPress "p" 80
#! call onMouseScroll 1
#! call onKeyPress "-" 189
#! call onKeyPress "-" 189
#! call onKeyPress "-" 189
#! call onKeyPress "p" 80
#! call render 16
# "o" again closes it: "p" does nothing
#! call onKeyPress "o" 79
#! call onKeyPress "p" 80
